1
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:12,630
♪Wealth fades away, fame fades away♪

2
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:16,790
♪All worldly pursuits
are fleeting dreams♪

3
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,350
♪Sorrow fades away,
resentment fades away♪

4
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:22,870
♪Anger and grudges are
but passing clouds♪

5
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:26,640
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

6
00:00:26,730 --> 00:00:30,150
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

7
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:37,230
♪This humble monk wanders freely
across the land♪

8
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:40,430
♪Laughing and fooling around,
yet bound by karma's law♪

9
00:00:41,240 --> 00:00:43,950
♪People spend their lives chasing
fortune and fearing misfortune♪

10
00:00:44,640 --> 00:00:47,110
♪Yet in a blink, all return to dust♪

11
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:50,230
♪They scheme endlessly in pursuit
of wealth and glory♪

12
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:53,580
♪But in the end, all things
simply pass by♪

13
00:00:54,440 --> 00:00:57,350
♪Better to follow the heart
and find true joy♪

14
00:00:57,640 --> 00:01:00,550
♪Don't let worldly troubles
bind your soul♪

15
00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:02,190
♪Walk on, walk on♪

16
00:01:02,560 --> 00:01:03,870
♪Roam on, roam on♪

17
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:07,430
♪With my worn-out fan in hand,
I care not for worldly woes♪

18
00:01:07,440 --> 00:01:08,750
♪Drink some wine♪

19
00:01:09,120 --> 00:01:10,510
♪Sail the rivers wide♪

20
00:01:10,520 --> 00:01:13,910
♪Simple robes and straw sandals
beat fine silk and fur♪

21
00:01:13,920 --> 00:01:17,070
♪Laugh at my carefree ways, a simple
fan is all I need to chase worries away♪

22
00:01:17,080 --> 00:01:20,470
♪Laugh at my shabby look, a half pot
of wine carries me through the years♪

23
00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:23,750
♪Wine and meat may pass through me,
but kindness stays in my heart♪

24
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:27,030
♪I cling not to appearances,
finding freedom through Zen's wisdom♪

25
00:01:27,040 --> 00:01:29,070
♪I travel north and south,
witnessing the world's endless tales♪

26
00:01:29,880 --> 00:01:32,540
♪I see life's joys and sorrows
in a single glance♪

27
00:01:33,080 --> 00:01:36,150
♪Those who harm the good and abuse
their power will face their reckoning♪

28
00:01:36,160 --> 00:01:39,630
♪Do good and cultivate virtue,
and worries will fade away♪

29
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:41,990
♪Don't frown over gains and losses♪

30
00:01:42,240 --> 00:01:45,750
♪True cultivation lies
in a joyful heart♪

31
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:48,870
♪Let right and wrong, love and hatred
drift away with the wind♪

32
00:01:48,880 --> 00:01:52,990
♪Live freely and wander this world
without restraint♪

33
00:01:53,780 --> 00:01:56,380
=The Mad Monk: Subdue Demons of Dragon's Fall=
=Episode 11=

34
00:01:57,260 --> 00:01:58,860
Take them to search the back.

35
00:01:59,540 --> 00:02:00,140
Go, go.

36
00:02:03,820 --> 00:02:04,940
What should we do?

37
00:02:04,940 --> 00:02:06,660
Look, look carefully.

38
00:02:06,660 --> 00:02:07,900
Master.

39
00:02:10,260 --> 00:02:11,460
Master.

40
00:02:11,460 --> 00:02:12,340
Master Guangliang is so big.

41
00:02:12,340 --> 00:02:13,580
How could he be hiding here?

42
00:02:13,580 --> 00:02:15,500
- Use your brain.
- (Master is back!)

43
00:02:16,020 --> 00:02:16,820
Oh!

44
00:02:16,980 --> 00:02:17,780
Oh my!

45
00:02:17,780 --> 00:02:19,100
Master Daoji!

46
00:02:19,100 --> 00:02:19,340
Ah.

47
00:02:19,340 --> 00:02:20,660
Did you find him?

48
00:02:20,660 --> 00:02:21,140
Yeah.

49
00:02:21,300 --> 00:02:22,100
We've searched the whole temple.

50
00:02:22,100 --> 00:02:23,100
He's not here.

51
00:02:23,100 --> 00:02:23,700
Oh no.

52
00:02:23,700 --> 00:02:26,020
Where did Master Guangliang go?

53
00:02:27,100 --> 00:02:28,380
The time has almost come.

54
00:02:28,380 --> 00:02:30,140
I'm about to return
to the Western Paradise.

55
00:02:30,140 --> 00:02:31,060
Oh no.

56
00:02:31,300 --> 00:02:32,180
- Master Daoji.
- Yes?

57
00:02:32,580 --> 00:02:34,660
You must tell Master Guangliang

58
00:02:34,660 --> 00:02:36,740
that we'll meet again someday.

59
00:02:36,740 --> 00:02:37,700
Yes, yes.

60
00:02:37,700 --> 00:02:38,140
Hey.

61
00:02:38,140 --> 00:02:39,620
When you see Buddha,

62
00:02:39,620 --> 00:02:40,940
send him a message for me.

63
00:02:40,940 --> 00:02:41,260
Okay.

64
00:02:41,340 --> 00:02:42,300
Tell him that

65
00:02:42,580 --> 00:02:43,900
his favorite disciple

66
00:02:43,900 --> 00:02:45,900
is being treated unfairly
in the mortal world.

67
00:02:46,020 --> 00:02:47,660
He has to stand up for me.

68
00:02:47,980 --> 00:02:48,660
Got it.

69
00:02:50,500 --> 00:02:51,100
Everyone,

70
00:02:51,980 --> 00:02:52,580
goodbye.

71
00:02:53,980 --> 00:02:56,460
Amitabha Buddha.

72
00:02:58,940 --> 00:02:59,940
(Buddha has finally
answered my prayers.)

73
00:02:59,940 --> 00:03:01,380
(This guy is finally leaving.)

74
00:03:01,660 --> 00:03:02,020
What?

75
00:03:02,140 --> 00:03:02,500
Huh?

76
00:03:03,340 --> 00:03:03,780
What?

77
00:03:03,900 --> 00:03:04,380
What happened?

78
00:03:04,860 --> 00:03:06,380
What's going on?

79
00:03:06,380 --> 00:03:09,140
What just happened?

80
00:03:09,140 --> 00:03:10,180
Are you crazy?

81
00:03:10,180 --> 00:03:11,660
You shouted louder than me.

82
00:03:11,660 --> 00:03:13,580
You scared my light away!

83
00:03:15,220 --> 00:03:15,700
This...

84
00:03:18,220 --> 00:03:18,740
Holy Monk.

85
00:03:19,260 --> 00:03:19,820
I was told

86
00:03:19,820 --> 00:03:21,300
someone is going to release
the Three-Headed Jiao.

87
00:03:21,700 --> 00:03:23,420
No wonder I couldn't return
to the Western Paradise.

88
00:03:23,420 --> 00:03:25,620
Someone has been interfering
with my mission!

89
00:03:25,860 --> 00:03:26,340
Don't worry.

90
00:03:26,340 --> 00:03:27,740
No matter who releases him,

91
00:03:27,740 --> 00:03:29,100
I won't let that Three-Headed Jiao

92
00:03:29,100 --> 00:03:30,540
come out and harm the mortal world.

93
00:03:30,540 --> 00:03:31,220
Piaopiao, let's go!

94
00:03:31,900 --> 00:03:32,740
Hmm.

95
00:03:33,380 --> 00:03:33,860
Hey.

96
00:03:36,180 --> 00:03:37,580
Celestial maiden Piaopiao.

97
00:03:37,580 --> 00:03:38,140
Hmm.

98
00:03:38,140 --> 00:03:39,540
Please.

99
00:03:40,220 --> 00:03:40,980
Coming.

100
00:03:43,260 --> 00:03:45,460
What's going on?

101
00:03:45,860 --> 00:03:46,500
My darling,

102
00:03:46,660 --> 00:03:48,020
I can finally get out.

103
00:03:48,300 --> 00:03:49,220
Ah?

104
00:03:50,700 --> 00:03:51,060
Seal!

105
00:03:53,700 --> 00:03:54,140
(Linglong Pagoda)

106
00:03:55,580 --> 00:03:55,940
Huh?

107
00:03:56,220 --> 00:03:56,580
Hey!

108
00:03:57,340 --> 00:03:57,700
Hey!

109
00:03:57,700 --> 00:03:58,060
Ah?

110
00:03:58,380 --> 00:03:59,220
(Linglong Pagoda)
Who are you?

111
00:03:59,220 --> 00:04:00,060
Why aren't you sleeping
in the middle of the night?

112
00:04:00,060 --> 00:04:01,060
You came here to mess with me?

113
00:04:01,940 --> 00:04:02,500
Oh, right.

114
00:04:02,500 --> 00:04:03,500
Who are you?

115
00:04:03,900 --> 00:04:05,540
I am Erlang Shen, Yang Jian.

116
00:04:05,540 --> 00:04:06,900
You tried to release a demon
without permission.

117
00:04:07,020 --> 00:04:07,940
It's a terrible crime!

118
00:04:08,020 --> 00:04:08,340
I...

119
00:04:08,660 --> 00:04:08,980
I...

120
00:04:08,980 --> 00:04:11,100
I had a very good reason

121
00:04:11,100 --> 00:04:13,020
for releasing the demon.

122
00:04:13,300 --> 00:04:14,180
No matter what,

123
00:04:14,180 --> 00:04:15,300
I'm your master.

124
00:04:16,100 --> 00:04:18,300
I don't want you to break Heaven's law.

125
00:04:18,700 --> 00:04:19,340
Master?

126
00:04:19,340 --> 00:04:20,780
You think you're special
because you have three eyes?

127
00:04:20,780 --> 00:04:21,660
I have a double chin.

128
00:04:21,660 --> 00:04:22,780
I could say I'm your master too.

129
00:04:22,980 --> 00:04:23,220
You...

130
00:04:24,180 --> 00:04:24,420
Hey.

131
00:04:26,020 --> 00:04:26,540
Dragon-Subduing Arhat?

132
00:04:26,700 --> 00:04:29,100
Perfect timing.

133
00:04:29,100 --> 00:04:29,460
Hey.

134
00:04:29,980 --> 00:04:30,940
Who do you think you are?

135
00:04:30,940 --> 00:04:32,500
Since when can you mess with my people?

136
00:04:32,500 --> 00:04:33,660
Cut it out, Dragon-Subduing Arhat.

137
00:04:34,100 --> 00:04:35,700
I'm here to stop him
from releasing the demon.

138
00:04:35,700 --> 00:04:36,380
Huh?

139
00:04:37,020 --> 00:04:38,420
Why would you do that?

140
00:04:39,900 --> 00:04:41,100
If I don't explain why,

141
00:04:41,100 --> 00:04:42,300
does anyone have a problem?

142
00:04:42,300 --> 00:04:42,700
Tsk.

143
00:04:42,980 --> 00:04:44,420
You didn't even move your tail,

144
00:04:44,420 --> 00:04:46,340
and I already knew
what you were thinking.

145
00:04:46,340 --> 00:04:47,180
You're pretty smart.

146
00:04:47,180 --> 00:04:49,540
You figured out I wanted to escape
through that hole.

147
00:04:49,540 --> 00:04:50,300
So I already

148
00:04:50,300 --> 00:04:51,740
blocked it off.

149
00:04:51,740 --> 00:04:52,140
Hey...

150
00:04:52,140 --> 00:04:52,660
- Master!
- Come back!

151
00:04:52,740 --> 00:04:53,540
- Come back!
- Stop!

152
00:04:53,820 --> 00:04:54,420
Oh.

153
00:04:54,780 --> 00:04:56,740
Why did he run so fast today?

154
00:04:56,740 --> 00:04:57,180
Dragon-Subduing Arhat.

155
00:04:57,180 --> 00:04:57,620
Huh?

156
00:04:57,620 --> 00:04:58,700
Why didn't you stop him?

157
00:04:58,700 --> 00:04:59,900
He's your man.

158
00:04:59,900 --> 00:05:01,220
Why didn't you chase him?

159
00:05:01,620 --> 00:05:03,300
He's here in the mortal world
because of you.

160
00:05:03,300 --> 00:05:04,780
Why should I deal with it?

161
00:05:04,780 --> 00:05:05,460
Listen.

162
00:05:05,820 --> 00:05:07,260
I used to give you some respect

163
00:05:07,260 --> 00:05:08,980
because of the Jade Emperor.

164
00:05:08,980 --> 00:05:10,340
But now you've betrayed him

165
00:05:10,340 --> 00:05:11,540
and sided with the Jade Empress.

166
00:05:11,860 --> 00:05:12,900
You've lost your powers.

167
00:05:13,020 --> 00:05:14,380
Killing you now

168
00:05:14,380 --> 00:05:15,540
would be easy.

169
00:05:15,860 --> 00:05:16,420
Fine.

170
00:05:16,420 --> 00:05:17,500
Go ahead.

171
00:05:17,500 --> 00:05:18,420
But if you do,

172
00:05:18,420 --> 00:05:20,860
I'll tell everyone how you got drunk
and harassed Chang'e,

173
00:05:20,860 --> 00:05:22,660
then blamed it

174
00:05:22,660 --> 00:05:24,020
on Marshal Tianpeng.

175
00:05:24,020 --> 00:05:24,460
You...

176
00:05:24,740 --> 00:05:25,340
Well?

177
00:05:25,540 --> 00:05:25,980
Huh?

178
00:05:26,300 --> 00:05:27,860
Let's keep the peace.

179
00:05:27,860 --> 00:05:28,260
Hey.

180
00:05:28,620 --> 00:05:29,420
I always want to know...

181
00:05:29,420 --> 00:05:30,900
With three eyes,

182
00:05:30,900 --> 00:05:32,700
do things look more
three-dimensional for you?

183
00:05:32,940 --> 00:05:33,260
Huh?

184
00:05:33,980 --> 00:05:34,300
Ouch!

185
00:05:35,220 --> 00:05:35,740
Dragon-Subduing Arhat!

186
00:05:37,220 --> 00:05:37,740
Dragon-Subduing Arhat!

187
00:05:37,740 --> 00:05:38,860
Master, stop fooling around!

188
00:05:38,860 --> 00:05:40,140
Go after him!

189
00:05:40,140 --> 00:05:40,660
Yeah!

190
00:05:41,060 --> 00:05:41,980
- Hurry!
- Dragon-Subduing Arhat!

191
00:05:43,860 --> 00:05:44,340
Dragon-Subduing Arhat!

192
00:05:44,540 --> 00:05:45,020
Dragon-Subduing Arhat!

193
00:05:46,820 --> 00:05:47,260
Dragon-Subduing Arhat!

194
00:05:50,980 --> 00:05:51,420
Dragon-Subduing Arhat!

195
00:05:52,020 --> 00:05:53,060
You blinded me!

196
00:05:53,420 --> 00:05:54,060
Just you wait!

197
00:05:56,620 --> 00:05:57,220
Ah!

198
00:05:57,500 --> 00:05:58,980
It was Master Guangliang!

199
00:05:58,980 --> 00:05:59,580
Hmm.

200
00:05:59,580 --> 00:06:01,780
Why did he release
the Three-Headed Jiao?

201
00:06:01,780 --> 00:06:03,020
I have no idea.

202
00:06:03,380 --> 00:06:03,660
Then...

203
00:06:04,460 --> 00:06:05,380
Where is he now?

204
00:06:05,460 --> 00:06:05,740
Oh!

205
00:06:05,940 --> 00:06:07,260
He took the Linglong Pagoda

206
00:06:07,260 --> 00:06:08,060
and ran away.

207
00:06:08,060 --> 00:06:09,220
So I chased after him.

208
00:06:09,220 --> 00:06:11,260
He ran, and I chased.

209
00:06:12,260 --> 00:06:12,980
And then?

210
00:06:13,420 --> 00:06:14,500
Then he got away.

211
00:06:14,500 --> 00:06:15,020
I didn't expect...

212
00:06:15,140 --> 00:06:17,140
Wow, that fat guy can really run.

213
00:06:17,260 --> 00:06:17,580
You...

214
00:06:17,900 --> 00:06:18,940
You didn't catch him?

215
00:06:18,940 --> 00:06:19,620
He's so fat.

216
00:06:19,620 --> 00:06:20,660
And you still couldn't catch him?

217
00:06:21,020 --> 00:06:22,620
No, I couldn't.

218
00:06:22,620 --> 00:06:23,300
Alas!

219
00:06:23,300 --> 00:06:24,180
I'll go after him myself.

220
00:06:24,620 --> 00:06:25,820
Good luck.

221
00:06:26,460 --> 00:06:27,340
Hey.

222
00:06:27,340 --> 00:06:28,020
Piaopiao.

223
00:06:28,860 --> 00:06:29,580
Oh my...

224
00:06:29,740 --> 00:06:30,820
Celestial maiden Piaopiao.

225
00:06:30,820 --> 00:06:31,420
Yes?

226
00:06:31,820 --> 00:06:32,860
Help me.

227
00:06:32,860 --> 00:06:34,100
I'm exhausted.

228
00:06:34,220 --> 00:06:35,500
Come on, let's go.

229
00:06:35,700 --> 00:06:36,700
Amitabha Buddha.

230
00:06:36,900 --> 00:06:37,740
Alas!

231
00:06:37,740 --> 00:06:38,180
Ah...

232
00:06:41,820 --> 00:06:43,860
- I'm exhausted.
- Come.

233
00:06:44,540 --> 00:06:45,460
- Oh...
- Come.

234
00:06:46,740 --> 00:06:47,660
Alas!

235
00:06:56,140 --> 00:06:57,220
You go out first.

236
00:06:57,220 --> 00:06:57,980
I have something important to do.

237
00:06:58,020 --> 00:06:58,500
Out.

238
00:06:58,580 --> 00:06:58,900
I...

239
00:06:59,060 --> 00:06:59,620
Come on.

240
00:06:59,740 --> 00:07:00,460
Hurry.

241
00:07:02,420 --> 00:07:03,420
Celestial maiden Yanzhi.

242
00:07:04,180 --> 00:07:04,700
Hey.

243
00:07:04,700 --> 00:07:05,540
Are you okay?

244
00:07:05,780 --> 00:07:06,340
I...

245
00:07:06,340 --> 00:07:07,500
I'm fine.

246
00:07:07,700 --> 00:07:08,740
I'm perfectly fine.

247
00:07:08,980 --> 00:07:10,540
If you want to stay healthy,

248
00:07:10,540 --> 00:07:11,780
you need to exercise more.

249
00:07:11,780 --> 00:07:12,700
I was just...

250
00:07:12,700 --> 00:07:13,340
I mean...

251
00:07:13,340 --> 00:07:14,300
I like...

252
00:07:14,300 --> 00:07:15,500
night running.

253
00:07:15,580 --> 00:07:15,980
Right.

254
00:07:16,580 --> 00:07:17,340
Why are you here?

255
00:07:17,780 --> 00:07:18,180
Oh.

256
00:07:18,580 --> 00:07:21,020
The Thunder God received
a message from above.

257
00:07:21,500 --> 00:07:23,020
He said you firmly supported

258
00:07:23,020 --> 00:07:24,300
the Empress in front of Erlang Shen.

259
00:07:24,300 --> 00:07:25,820
- She was very touched.
- Ah...

260
00:07:26,620 --> 00:07:27,300
It's nothing.

261
00:07:27,660 --> 00:07:28,900
- And I also heard...
- Yes?

262
00:07:28,900 --> 00:07:30,100
that you even insulted the Jade Emperor.

263
00:07:30,100 --> 00:07:30,420
What?

264
00:07:30,420 --> 00:07:31,250
If the Jade Emperor

265
00:07:31,250 --> 00:07:32,620
didn't apologize to the Empress,

266
00:07:32,820 --> 00:07:33,860
you would lead her

267
00:07:33,860 --> 00:07:35,100
to storm Hall of Miraculous Mist, right?

268
00:07:35,540 --> 00:07:36,860
After she took power,

269
00:07:37,020 --> 00:07:38,420
you would marry into her family

270
00:07:38,420 --> 00:07:39,740
and become the new Jade Emperor.

271
00:07:39,740 --> 00:07:40,140
Hey, hey!

272
00:07:40,140 --> 00:07:41,420
I never said that!

273
00:07:41,420 --> 00:07:42,940
Someone must have made that up.

274
00:07:42,940 --> 00:07:43,660
Hmm.

275
00:07:43,660 --> 00:07:44,660
True.

276
00:07:44,660 --> 00:07:45,580
The Empress knew right away

277
00:07:45,580 --> 00:07:47,100
that it was Erlang Shen

278
00:07:47,100 --> 00:07:48,340
who exaggerated everything.

279
00:07:48,340 --> 00:07:48,860
Oh.

280
00:07:50,100 --> 00:07:50,900
Oh my...

281
00:07:51,540 --> 00:07:52,180
Good.

282
00:07:52,180 --> 00:07:53,740
Thank goodness the Empress understood.

283
00:07:53,740 --> 00:07:55,300
But the Jade Emperor was furious.

284
00:07:55,300 --> 00:07:55,660
Ah?

285
00:07:55,660 --> 00:07:57,300
He plans to send someone to silence you.

286
00:07:57,300 --> 00:07:57,900
Ah?

287
00:07:59,220 --> 00:08:00,020
What?

288
00:08:00,020 --> 00:08:00,460
Yes.

289
00:08:00,620 --> 00:08:01,620
The Jade Emperor also heard

290
00:08:02,020 --> 00:08:03,960
that you wanted to stop someone

291
00:08:03,961 --> 00:08:05,900
from releasing the demon
inside the Linglong Pagoda.

292
00:08:05,900 --> 00:08:07,220
So he ordered Erlang Shen

293
00:08:07,220 --> 00:08:09,180
to release that demon no matter what.

294
00:08:09,600 --> 00:08:10,200
Oh no...

295
00:08:10,200 --> 00:08:11,100
The Empress believes

296
00:08:11,100 --> 00:08:12,260
that in front of Erlang Shen,

297
00:08:12,260 --> 00:08:13,660
you absolutely must win this fight.

298
00:08:13,660 --> 00:08:14,740
You can't let her lose face.

299
00:08:14,980 --> 00:08:15,500
Yes.

300
00:08:15,500 --> 00:08:16,700
Stopping the demon from being released

301
00:08:16,700 --> 00:08:17,420
is my responsibility.

302
00:08:17,420 --> 00:08:17,940
Besides,

303
00:08:17,940 --> 00:08:19,580
I can't stand that three-eyed guy
either.

304
00:08:19,580 --> 00:08:20,580
But

305
00:08:20,580 --> 00:08:22,620
I've lost all my powers.

306
00:08:22,620 --> 00:08:24,420
I can only do my best.

307
00:08:24,420 --> 00:08:25,260
- But...
- Huh?

308
00:08:25,260 --> 00:08:27,900
Judging from the situation now,

309
00:08:27,900 --> 00:08:29,500
I think the Empress's dignity

310
00:08:29,500 --> 00:08:32,140
is about to shatter into pieces.

311
00:08:32,460 --> 00:08:33,220
Alas!

312
00:08:34,420 --> 00:08:35,543
Actually, the Empress

313
00:08:35,544 --> 00:08:37,340
understands your situation very well.

314
00:08:37,460 --> 00:08:38,820
- Huh?
- She knows you're difficult.

315
00:08:38,820 --> 00:08:39,180
Yes.

316
00:08:39,820 --> 00:08:40,700
But she said...

317
00:08:40,700 --> 00:08:40,980
Huh?

318
00:08:40,980 --> 00:08:42,700
If you can't defeat Erlang Shen,

319
00:08:42,820 --> 00:08:44,260
she'll order Thunder God

320
00:08:44,260 --> 00:08:45,580
to strike you dead
with heavenly thunder.

321
00:08:47,100 --> 00:08:47,700
Ah!

322
00:08:48,460 --> 00:08:48,980
Ah?

323
00:08:49,340 --> 00:08:50,140
Strike me dead?

324
00:08:50,140 --> 00:08:50,540
Yes.

325
00:08:51,300 --> 00:08:51,820
Alas!

326
00:08:52,580 --> 00:08:53,700
Alas!

327
00:08:55,940 --> 00:08:57,020
- Wait here.
- Huh?

328
00:08:57,020 --> 00:08:58,580
I'm going to settle this

329
00:08:58,940 --> 00:08:59,460
with that three-eyed freak!

330
00:09:00,380 --> 00:09:01,420
Alas!

331
00:09:01,420 --> 00:09:01,940
Huh?

332
00:09:01,940 --> 00:09:02,700
Hey!

333
00:09:02,940 --> 00:09:03,420
Do you really

334
00:09:03,420 --> 00:09:04,820
have to go right now?

335
00:09:08,100 --> 00:09:09,340
Come here, come here.

336
00:09:10,060 --> 00:09:11,020
Come on.

337
00:09:11,980 --> 00:09:12,940
Young man,

338
00:09:12,940 --> 00:09:14,380
you look exhausted.

339
00:09:14,380 --> 00:09:16,380
Try some delicious food.

340
00:09:19,900 --> 00:09:20,980
Hand-grabbed rice?

341
00:09:21,660 --> 00:09:22,620
The Western Regions?

342
00:09:23,460 --> 00:09:25,260
How did I end up here?

343
00:09:28,060 --> 00:09:29,500
Please, just kill me.

344
00:09:29,500 --> 00:09:31,100
I'm about to be shaken to death.

345
00:09:36,420 --> 00:09:36,940
Erlang Shen.

346
00:09:37,580 --> 00:09:39,180
Where did your Howling Celestial Dog go?

347
00:09:39,500 --> 00:09:40,020
Hmph.

348
00:09:40,380 --> 00:09:41,820
I'll summon him

349
00:09:42,220 --> 00:09:43,260
with my magic.

350
00:09:43,500 --> 00:09:43,860
Come forth!

351
00:09:48,860 --> 00:09:49,700
You again?

352
00:09:50,020 --> 00:09:51,300
Give me back my pagoda!

353
00:09:52,940 --> 00:09:53,780
Hold on, Heavenly King.

354
00:09:56,340 --> 00:09:56,980
This time,

355
00:09:57,420 --> 00:09:58,540
I'm here to help you

356
00:09:58,540 --> 00:09:59,700
release the demon.

357
00:09:59,900 --> 00:10:00,340
Hand it over.

358
00:10:00,620 --> 00:10:01,060
Huh?

359
00:10:03,060 --> 00:10:03,740
Wait.

360
00:10:05,420 --> 00:10:06,700
Why is it so noisy?

361
00:10:06,700 --> 00:10:07,820
It's so loud!

362
00:10:08,300 --> 00:10:08,940
Give it back!

363
00:10:09,820 --> 00:10:11,180
No, no!

364
00:10:11,540 --> 00:10:12,020
Dragon-Subduing Arhat.

365
00:10:12,380 --> 00:10:14,420
We are acting under
the Jade Emperor's orders.

366
00:10:14,820 --> 00:10:15,620
And you think

367
00:10:15,940 --> 00:10:16,740
you can stop us?

368
00:10:17,100 --> 00:10:18,180
You three-eyed freak.

369
00:10:18,180 --> 00:10:19,380
You went behind my back and reported me.

370
00:10:19,380 --> 00:10:20,820
I haven't settled that with you yet.

371
00:10:21,020 --> 00:10:22,260
So what if I framed you?

372
00:10:22,580 --> 00:10:23,540
Not only did I frame you,

373
00:10:23,540 --> 00:10:25,620
today I'll take your life too.

374
00:10:25,740 --> 00:10:26,340
What?

375
00:10:27,380 --> 00:10:27,980
Blame yourself

376
00:10:28,180 --> 00:10:29,820
for choosing the wrong side.

377
00:10:30,140 --> 00:10:31,500
You sided with the Jade Empress.

378
00:10:31,740 --> 00:10:33,660
And she actually sent you here to die

379
00:10:33,660 --> 00:10:34,900
without a single helper.

380
00:10:36,540 --> 00:10:37,300
Who says I have no help?

381
00:10:37,300 --> 00:10:38,100
Isn't she one?

382
00:10:40,780 --> 00:10:41,820
Who says he has no help?

383
00:10:43,180 --> 00:10:44,060
Didn't I come?

384
00:10:44,260 --> 00:10:46,100
Third Prince, you're a true friend!

385
00:10:46,100 --> 00:10:46,820
You unfilial son!

386
00:10:47,300 --> 00:10:47,900
Don't be reckless!

387
00:10:48,340 --> 00:10:49,180
Helping him

388
00:10:49,580 --> 00:10:50,740
means opposing the Jade Emperor.

389
00:10:50,980 --> 00:10:51,380
Hmph.

390
00:10:51,700 --> 00:10:53,460
I don't care if it's the Jade Emperor
or the Empress.

391
00:10:53,940 --> 00:10:54,900
Whoever stands against you,

392
00:10:54,900 --> 00:10:55,620
I'll stand with them.

393
00:10:55,820 --> 00:10:56,900
- You unfilial son!
- Heavenly King!

394
00:10:57,780 --> 00:10:59,020
This is your son's own choice.

395
00:10:59,980 --> 00:11:00,780
Nezha.

396
00:11:01,380 --> 00:11:02,220
Your father may fear you,

397
00:11:02,540 --> 00:11:03,420
but I don't.

398
00:11:04,060 --> 00:11:04,380
Hey!

399
00:11:06,540 --> 00:11:08,020
He's still just a child!

400
00:11:08,340 --> 00:11:09,060
Thunder God,

401
00:11:09,620 --> 00:11:10,780
what are you doing here?

402
00:11:12,180 --> 00:11:13,740
I am here by the Empress's command

403
00:11:13,740 --> 00:11:15,860
to assist Dragon-Subduing Arhat.

404
00:11:18,220 --> 00:11:19,100
With just you?

405
00:11:19,220 --> 00:11:20,340
A mad monk,

406
00:11:20,340 --> 00:11:21,260
a demon,

407
00:11:21,420 --> 00:11:22,580
a little brat,

408
00:11:22,580 --> 00:11:23,860
and you, a sissy?

409
00:11:23,860 --> 00:11:25,340
How do you expect to fight me?

410
00:11:25,340 --> 00:11:26,180
I think the Jade Empress

411
00:11:26,180 --> 00:11:28,100
must have completely lost her mind.

412
00:11:29,420 --> 00:11:30,180
How dare you!

413
00:11:30,540 --> 00:11:31,980
How dare you insult Her Majesty!

414
00:11:31,980 --> 00:11:33,900
I have brought Her Majesty's adopted son

415
00:11:33,900 --> 00:11:35,380
here to subdue you.

416
00:11:35,500 --> 00:11:36,540
Don't try to scare me.

417
00:11:36,540 --> 00:11:37,380
Since when

418
00:11:37,620 --> 00:11:39,100
did she have an adopted son?

419
00:11:39,460 --> 00:11:40,500
Didn't you know?

420
00:11:40,500 --> 00:11:41,740
Just yesterday,

421
00:11:41,740 --> 00:11:44,300
the Empress adopted the Monkey King
as her son.

422
00:11:44,820 --> 00:11:46,980
Has the Empress become that desperate?

423
00:11:46,980 --> 00:11:48,620
She went to some circus

424
00:11:48,620 --> 00:11:50,060
and found some nameless monkey

425
00:11:50,060 --> 00:11:51,220
to be her adopted son.

426
00:11:51,220 --> 00:11:51,940
This time,

427
00:11:51,940 --> 00:11:53,100
she's definitely going to lose.

428
00:11:54,540 --> 00:11:55,940
(Who says I have no name?)

429
00:11:59,060 --> 00:12:01,900
I am Sun Wukong, the Monkey King
of Shuilian Cave, Huaguo Mountain.

430
00:12:01,900 --> 00:12:04,540
I'm the Great Sage Equaling Heaven!

431
00:12:11,140 --> 00:12:14,190
♪My shoes are worn, my hat is torn♪

432
00:12:14,540 --> 00:12:17,390
♪Even my monk's robe is tattered♪

433
00:12:17,520 --> 00:12:21,190
♪Everything I own is worn and weathered♪

434
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:24,270
♪Yet I laugh and live free as can be♪

435
00:12:24,680 --> 00:12:31,430
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

436
00:12:31,440 --> 00:12:34,990
♪With Buddha dwelling in my heart♪

437
00:12:41,680 --> 00:12:44,910
♪Once, I was known as Li Xiuyuan♪

438
00:12:44,920 --> 00:12:48,150
♪Now I bear the name Ji Dian♪

439
00:12:48,440 --> 00:12:51,470
♪After the wedding,
I became an immortal♪

440
00:12:51,480 --> 00:12:53,150
♪I thought of the Arhat
who subdued the tiger♪

441
00:12:53,160 --> 00:12:55,070
♪And there he was, right by my side,
oh my♪

442
00:12:55,080 --> 00:12:56,630
♪I left my wife behind♪

443
00:12:56,800 --> 00:12:58,230
♪And headed straight to Lingyin Temple♪

444
00:12:58,240 --> 00:13:02,070
♪Living a life of hiding here
and running there♪

445
00:13:02,080 --> 00:13:03,190
♪As long as thunder doesn't strike♪

446
00:13:03,200 --> 00:13:05,310
♪I still dare to make a solemn vow♪

447
00:13:05,320 --> 00:13:06,990
♪With me around, nothing can go wrong♪

448
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:08,870
♪Waiter, bring me a plate
of chicken wings♪

449
00:13:08,880 --> 00:13:12,230
♪People laugh and say I'm lost
and foolish♪

450
00:13:12,240 --> 00:13:15,510
♪Guangliang always nags and scolds me♪

451
00:13:15,720 --> 00:13:18,630
♪His endless lectures come
from worry I'll cause trouble♪

452
00:13:18,640 --> 00:13:21,990
♪I say Buddha lives within my heart♪

453
00:13:22,000 --> 00:13:25,670
♪Wine and meat may pass through my body♪

454
00:13:25,680 --> 00:13:29,030
♪I wander around, I stroll along♪

455
00:13:29,040 --> 00:13:32,110
♪Leaving all my worries behind♪

456
00:13:32,680 --> 00:13:35,750
♪Take a sip, take a bite♪

457
00:13:35,760 --> 00:13:39,190
♪I don't overthink this life of mine♪

458
00:13:39,200 --> 00:13:42,750
♪You chase fame and fight
over fortune and fate♪

459
00:13:42,760 --> 00:13:46,230
♪You're just wasting your time♪

460
00:13:46,240 --> 00:13:49,190
♪They all call me a Living Buddha♪

461
00:13:49,200 --> 00:13:50,870
♪And I just laugh happily♪

462
00:13:50,880 --> 00:13:54,270
♪Wishing joy and happiness
for all in this world♪

463
00:14:02,960 --> 00:14:06,550
♪People laugh and say I'm lost
and foolish♪

464
00:14:06,560 --> 00:14:09,950
♪Guangliang always nags and scolds me♪

465
